{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mteXet39T31792675206.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐盟的「新北極」戰略，將中俄北極合作視為安全隱患。中方指在北極活動目的，是推動和平穩定與可持續發展，符合國際法。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧稱：「北極涉及國際社會的整體利益，各國依法在北極開展活動的權利和自由，應當得到充分尊重。中國在北極的活動旨在促進北極和平穩定和可持續發展，符合國際法。以冷戰思維劃分陣營，挑動地緣對抗，不利於北極地區的和平穩定發展。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:02:19.638466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.955212+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:57:48.620236+00:00","content_hash":"021169e232bbda94017ec87d89fea727c8de672ec44a2ecf01984ebfc3e44d48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:02:19.638466+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}